  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Prstamo CT y Sectorial Agrcola</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TC Loan and Agricultural Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO SUPPORT THE INSTITUTIONAL AND POLICY REFORMS TO INCREASE PRODUCTION AND PRODUCTIVITY IN THE SECTOR, RATIONALIZE THE USE OF NATURAL RESOURCES AND IMPROVE THE NUTRITIONAL DELIVERY SYSTEM TO LOW INCOME GROUPS. IT WOULD INCLUDE PRICE POLICY, STATE ROL&apos;S, INCENTIVE SYSTEM, LEGAL FRAME AND ASSISTANT PROGRAMS TO LOW INCOME GROUPS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
